{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15204020","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1520402001:0":{"text":"我们真的要去<style=\"highlight\">南边</style>吗？饥荒这么久……真的还能<style=\"highlight\">捕到野兽</style>吗？会不会是骗人的？","source_cn":"我们真的要去<style=highlight>南边</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D84F950278B11D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520402002:1":{"text":"放心吧，肯定是真的！","source_cn":"放心吧，肯定是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD185939B716CEDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520402003:1":{"text":"你没听说那附近有个<style=\"highlight\">小营地</style>吗？好多人早就过去捕猎了。据说隔个三两天就能吃上一顿饱饭，甚至运气好，会有热乎的肉汤喝！","source_cn":"你没听说那附近有个<style=highlight>小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A029867C58E3E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520402004:0":{"text":"能吃饱……还有肉汤……","source_cn":"能吃饱……还有肉汤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91C5B91641A7FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520402005:0":{"text":"妈妈，我也想去……我也想喝肉汤！","source_cn":"妈妈，我也想去……我也想喝肉汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E7E85D7469FF85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520402006:0":{"text":"这……","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD138B4DADD74A1CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520402007:0":{"text":"反正我准备过去投奔他们了，不如一起搭伙过去吧。","source_cn":"反正我准备过去投奔他们了，不如一起搭伙过去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03BB73BC55D07869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520402008:0":{"text":"噗……搭伙？搭伙去送死吗？","source_cn":"噗……搭伙？搭伙去送死吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x132945FA60666A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520402009:1":{"text":"鬣狗也想吃饱饭，你们饿了这么久，还有多少力气？够它们吃吗？","source_cn":"鬣狗也想吃饱饭，你们饿了这么久，还有多少力气？够它们吃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF38BB38DA07F27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520402010:0":{"text":"你……你这人怎么说话呢？！我们只是想吃顿饱饭，想活下去！","source_cn":"你……你这人怎么说话呢？！我们只是想吃顿饱饭，想活下去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A4DFB58600C527B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520402011:0":{"text":"诸位，请勿动怒。我代替他向你们道歉。","source_cn":"诸位，请勿动怒。我代替他向你们道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FC95C41879E05F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520402012:0":{"text":"摩根说话直白，但请相信他绝无冒犯之意。更何况的确如他所说，能在饥荒中幸存下来的野兽绝非凡人之力可以匹敌。","source_cn":"摩根说话直白，但请相信他绝无冒犯之意。更何况的确如他所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D47E2AA53373970","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520402013:0":{"text":"那又怎么样？我们没有别的选择了！","source_cn":"那又怎么样？我们没有别的选择了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8340C5226361311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520402014:1":{"text":"是的……我们没有不去的选择。","source_cn":"是的……我们没有不去的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82DD5EA5C649EA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520402015:0":{"text":"就算留在这里，我们也会饿死。但如果去了南边，说不定还能活下来。","source_cn":"就算留在这里，我们也会饿死。但如果去了南边，说不定还能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF1A535E5C37A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520402016:0":{"text":"只要我儿子能活下来，哪怕我死了也没关系……","source_cn":"只要我儿子能活下来，哪怕我死了也没关系……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD44A9138A41348C","varia